{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12340","headline":"酬长孙绎蓝溪寄杏 · 钱起","name":"酬长孙绎蓝溪寄杏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱君蓝水上，种杏近成田。\n拂迳清阴合，临流彩实悬。\n清香和宿雨，佳色出晴烟。\n懿此倾筐赠，想知怀橘年。\n芳馨来满袖，琼玖愿詶篇。\n把玩情何极，云林若眼前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}